{"title": "Breakout myths, tested", "type": "Myth or fact", "hooks": ["Three breakout beliefs. Only one of them is true.", "Most beginners trust breakouts. This chart says be careful.", "Stop trusting every breakout. Check these three things first."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop trusting every breakout. Check these three things first.", "text": "Only one is true", "chart": null}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Myth or fact?", "vo": "Myth: a wick above the level is a breakout. Myth: any close will do. Fact: breakouts fail often, and this chart shows it.", "items": [{"text": "A wick is enough", "sub": "Myth: traders want a close", "icon": "cross"}, {"text": "Any close will do", "sub": "Myth: check the volume too", "icon": "cross"}, {"text": "Breakouts fail often", "sub": "Fact: here is the proof", "icon": "check"}], "cues": [{"say": "a wick above the level", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "any close will do", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "breakouts fail often", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Real or fake?", "vo": "This price has just closed above the last twenty candles' high. Real breakout, or fake?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["Real: it keeps going", "Fake: it falls back inside the range"], "answer": 1, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 28.75, "label": "20-candle high", "tone": "trigger"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Fake", "vo": "Fake. Within six candles it closed back inside the range. The breakout candle had only zero point four times the average volume.", "cues": [{"say": "back inside the range", "do": "shade", "from": 90, "to": 96, "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Weak volume, weak breakout", "vo": "So look for volume that grows on the break, a close beyond the level, and a retest that holds.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Stop just inside the range", "vo": "And keep a stop just inside the old range, so a fake one limits the damage.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Spot the fake ones", "vo": "Practise spotting fake breakouts for free at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three breakout beliefs. Only one of them is true.\n\nA wick above the level is not a breakout. Traders want a close.\nAny close is not enough either. Volume should grow on the break.\nThis one closed above the high on weak volume and fell back inside the range within six candles.\n\nSave this for the next breakout you see.\nPractise at memestreet.net\n\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #ChartReading #Breakout #TradingForBeginners", "charts": [{"candles": [[24.47, 24.48, 24.43, 24.47, 6345875], [24.47, 24.72, 24.41, 24.72, 33308917], [24.72, 24.89, 24.67, 24.89, 12635184], [24.89, 25.04, 24.89, 25.04, 5028154], [25.04, 25.38, 25.04, 25.3, 11559492], [25.3, 25.32, 25.28, 25.32, 3336305], [25.32, 25.35, 25.3, 25.3, 2724035], [25.39, 25.45, 25.13, 25.27, 32692629], [25.26, 25.28, 25.08, 25.11, 10801500], [25.11, 25.18, 25.01, 25.09, 12182934], [25.08, 25.22, 25.07, 25.16, 21101351], [25.15, 25.26, 25.15, 25.22, 10326082], [25.22, 25.28, 25.17, 25.28, 11289748], [25.28, 25.36, 24.74, 25.02, 41173269], [25.01, 25.14, 24.95, 25.03, 21231843], [25.03, 25.13, 24.99, 25.11, 11936868], [25.11, 25.17, 25.0, 25.17, 17949282], [25.17, 25.23, 25.16, 25.21, 3229241], [25.22, 25.24, 24.72, 24.73, 4730587], [24.77, 24.79, 24.32, 24.49, 37649466], [24.49, 24.72, 24.34, 24.5, 16710116], [24.49, 24.56, 24.33, 24.47, 13380527], [24.46, 24.58, 24.43, 24.53, 11934172], [24.52, 24.53, 24.32, 24.49, 5711832], [24.5, 24.52, 24.43, 24.45, 4181168], [24.53, 24.71, 24.37, 24.38, 21348598], [24.37, 24.54, 24.29, 24.48, 13522098], [24.49, 24.61, 23.9, 24.2, 19534191], [24.21, 25.0, 24.13, 24.76, 19505446], [24.76, 24.81, 24.69, 24.72, 5307994], [24.72, 24.78, 24.58, 24.62, 16828610], [24.67, 25.72, 24.48, 25.32, 105967478], [2